WEBVTT

NOTE English captions for https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9k7QxXtCzaQ, from YouTube, repeats removed.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.380
what is the difference between sahabat and chakra what is translated as patience and complaining

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:13.710
one of the things to keep in mind is that the concept and the idea of

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:18.990
patience and the word patience itself is not the greatest translation for summer in the Arabic

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:24.539
language why because Soviet as we know it is to refrain or detain or stop something

00:00:24.539 --> 00:00:31.019
from happening in the religious context it's to hold oneself back from something that is detrimental

00:00:31.019 --> 00:00:36.030
so during times of hardship for example you are holding yourself back and refraining from saying

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:41.040
or doing that which is displeasing to Allah as for complaining there are two different types

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:46.890
of complaints there is complaining to Allah subhana WA Ta'ala and the example that we have

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:53.070
is from the Quran nama ash kuba 'they were hosni in allah yahoo bali he said

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:57.840
i'm said i complained of my grief and my hardship to allah subhanho wa taala so

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:02.190
you are asking upon allah subhanaw taala are you allowed to say oh Allah I call

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:06.000
upon you and I am weak and I'm complaining to you of my weakness it is

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.650
permissible based on some authentic narrations as well and Allah knows best but with regards to

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:17.070
the second type it is complaining about our problems our decrees our issues to other people

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:23.610
where are the guidelines here we want to be consistent with our gratitude to Allah but

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:28.259
at the same time we realize yes it is permissible to go ask for advice from

00:01:28.259 --> 00:01:32.189
other people it is permissible to speak about our problems but not in a way in

00:01:32.189 --> 00:01:36.810
which we are complaining about our fate our blessings and so on and so forth rather

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:41.400
in terms of seeking advice from those who have experience or those who can relate or

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:45.600
those who can advise us and be there for us but generally speaking we complain of

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:51.780
our problems to allah subhana wa ta'ala asking him with our weakness for help because he

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:55.489
is on lawsuit on Owatonna the exalted and allah knows best
